        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing idle game inspired by several others of the same genre. Do ya thang while your quails bounce around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063700/extras/653003a94e054a60188055bf06063f1e.avif?t=1764118425\" alt=\"Game open over a firefox window googling how to make a game easy mispelled\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063700/extras_big/653003a94e054a60188055bf06063f1e.webp?t=1764118425 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What this game is:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An idle game that requires little attention</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A creature collection game with no combat, with more quails coming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple incremental game where you buy upgrades to quicken gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What this game isn't:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game to play actively</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A trojan virus</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first person shooter</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness your cute quails lay eggs and sell them off for profit!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063700/extras/2004bf5f9e042213878886a8af56a422.poster.avif?t=1764118425\" aria-label=\"A short gif of a quail laying an egg and jumping around\" width=1080 height=636 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063700/extras/2004bf5f9e042213878886a8af56a422.webm?t=1764118425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063700/extras/2004bf5f9e042213878886a8af56a422.mp4?t=1764118425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock all the quail! More Coming Soon™️</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063700/extras/83fe400a58c69f858125935c1c83597c.poster.avif?t=1764118425\" aria-label=\"A short gif scrolling through the quail collection log\" width=1094 height=738 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063700/extras/83fe400a58c69f858125935c1c83597c.webm?t=1764118425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063700/extras/83fe400a58c69f858125935c1c83597c.mp4?t=1764118425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing idle game inspired by several others of the same genre. Do ya thang while your quails bounce around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063700/extras/653003a94e054a60188055bf06063f1e.avif?t=1764118425\" alt=\"Game open over a firefox window googling how to make a game easy mispelled\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063700/extras_big/653003a94e054a60188055bf06063f1e.webp?t=1764118425 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What this game is:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An idle game that requires little attention</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A creature collection game with no combat, with more quails coming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple incremental game where you buy upgrades to quicken gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What this game isn't:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game to play actively</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A trojan virus</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first person shooter</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness your cute quails lay eggs and sell them off for profit!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063700/extras/2004bf5f9e042213878886a8af56a422.poster.avif?t=1764118425\" aria-label=\"A short gif of a quail laying an egg and jumping around\" width=1080 height=636 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063700/extras/2004bf5f9e042213878886a8af56a422.webm?t=1764118425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.s